\subsection{Approximations of $\mathbb{S}^d_{+}$} \label{sec:approx}
In this section, we explore an  outer approximation $\outerName$ of  $\mathbb{S}^d_{+}$  parametrized by a set $\setName$
of $d \times k$ rectangular matrices. The parametrization is chosen such that the dual cone $\approxName$ equals the \emph{Minkowski sum} of faces $W_i \mathbb{S}^{k}_{+} W_i^T$ of $\mathbb{S}^d_{+}$ 
for $W_i \in \setName$.  It is defined below:

